COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."land_leases"."our_share_pct" IS 'Profit share: our percentage of the field''s net (revenue less the shared inputs). 50 on a 50/50 deal.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."land_leases"."direction" IS '''in'' = land we rent from its owner (landlord is the owner). ''out'' = our land a grower farms (landlord is the grower); profit_share then means our_share_pct of the gross comes to us and the grower pays the inputs, cash_rent means rent we receive.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."land_leases"."crop_ids" IS 'Crops the deal covers on its fields; null = every crop. Lets a split field carry one deal per crop.';



